## User

The factorial of a natural number.

## Type

type
```lean
def fact (n : ℕ) : ℕ
```

## Term

```lean
n * fact n
```

## lean

proposition
```lean
theorem fact_zero : fact 0 = 0
```

## lean

proposition
```lean
theorem fact_succ (n : ℕ) : fact (n + 1) = fact n + 1
```

## lean

proposition
```lean
theorem fact_succ_zero : fact 0 = 0
```

